    "html": "<main class=\"w-full max-w-[640px] min-h-screen sm:min-h-0 sm:rounded-xl bg-[#fbf9f4] border-x sm:border border-parchment-border shadow-2xl flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden\">\n<!-- Workbench Atelier Top Navigation: Minimal & Focused -->\n<header class=\"bg-[#f5efe4] border-b border-parchment-border px-4 py-3 sticky top-0 z-40 backdrop-blur-md bg-opacity-95\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 text-primary\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[17px]\">checklist</span></span><div><h1 class=\"font-serif text-[17px] font-semibold text-[#241f1a] leading-none tracking-tight flex items-center gap-1.5\">任务协作总览<span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-normal uppercase text-stone-500 bg-stone-200/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded\">Overview</span></h1></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-white/80 border border-parchment-border font-mono text-[11px] text-stone-600 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary animate-pulse\"></span>只读演示</span></div></div><nav class=\"flex items-center gap-6 pt-1 font-mono text-[12px] border-t border-parchment-border/60\"><a class=\"text-primary font-bold border-b-2 border-primary pb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-default\" href=\"#overview\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\">assignment</span>任务总览</a><a class=\"text-stone-500 hover:text-stone-800 pb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors\" href=\"#session\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\">forum</span>子任务详情</a><a class=\"text-stone-500 hover:text-stone-800 pb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors\" href=\"#usage\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\">analytics</span>用量说明</a></nav></header>\n<!-- Main Workspace Body: The Unfolded Manuscript on the Desk -->\n<div class=\"p-4 sm:p-5 space-y-5 pb-24\"><section class=\"bg-white rounded-lg border border-parchment-border p-3.5 sm:p-4 shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[11px] text-stone-500 mb-1.5\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold text-stone-700\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-primary\">folder_open</span>父任务</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-700 bg-amber-100/60 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 animate-pulse\"></span>进行中</span><span class=\"text-stone-400 font-serif\">·</span><span class=\"text-stone-600 font-mono text-[11px]\">已完成 1/3 个子任务</span></div></div><div><h2 class=\"font-serif text-[17px] font-semibold text-stone-900 leading-snug\">修复报表筛选异常</h2><p class=\"font-serif text-[13px] text-stone-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed\">清空筛选后回到第一页；请求失败时保留已填写的内容</p></div><div class=\"w-full bg-stone-100 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-3 overflow-hidden flex\"><div class=\"bg-secondary h-full\" style=\"width: 33.3%\"></div><div class=\"bg-blue-500 h-full\" style=\"width: 33.3%\"></div><div class=\"bg-stone-200 h-full\" style=\"width: 33.4%\"></div></div></section><section class=\"space-y-2.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-1 font-mono text-[11px] text-stone-500\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[13px]\">account_tree</span>子任务分解 (3)</span><span class=\"font-serif italic text-stone-400\">按顺序执行推进</span></div><div class=\"relative pl-3 border-l-2 border-[#e6dcce] space-y-2.5 ml-2\"><div class=\"relative bg-white/95 rounded-lg border border-parchment-border p-3 shadow-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-400 font-bold\">#01</span><h3 class=\"font-serif text-[14.5px] font-semibold text-stone-800\">修复清空后的页码</h3></div><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-[10.5px] font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-100/70 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[12px]\">check_circle</span>已完成</span></div><p class=\"font-serif text-[12.5px] text-stone-600 leading-snug mb-2\">清空筛选后会回到第一页</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-2 border-t border-parchment-border/60 font-mono text-[11px] text-stone-500\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span>执行人: <strong class=\"text-stone-700 font-semibold\">Qoder</strong></span><span class=\"text-stone-300\">·</span><span class=\"text-stone-400\">消耗: 12.4k Token</span></div><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[10px] text-stone-500 bg-stone-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded\">已通过自检，已提交</span></div></div><div class=\"relative bg-[#f8faff] rounded-lg border-2 border-blue-200/90 p-3 shadow-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-blue-500 font-bold\">#02</span><h3 class=\"font-serif text-[14.5px] font-semibold text-blue-900\">保留报错前的输入</h3></div><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-[10.5px] font-bold text-blue-700 bg-blue-100/80 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 animate-pulse\"></span>处理中</span></div><p class=\"font-serif text-[12.5px] text-stone-700 leading-snug mb-2\">正在检查失败后能否恢复草稿</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-2 border-t border-blue-100 font-mono text-[11px] text-stone-500\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span>执行人: <strong class=\"text-blue-900 font-semibold\">Qoder</strong></span><span class=\"text-stone-300\">·</span><span class=\"text-stone-500\">消耗: 30.8k Token</span></div><a class=\"shrink-0 inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-white text-ink-blue font-bold text-[11px] border border-blue-200 shadow-xs hover:bg-blue-50 transition-colors\" href=\"#session\"><span>查看会话详情</span><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[12px]\">arrow_forward</span></a></div></div><div class=\"relative bg-white/80 rounded-lg border border-amber-900/20 p-3 shadow-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-400 font-bold\">#03</span><h3 class=\"font-serif text-[14.5px] font-semibold text-stone-800\">检查筛选和报错分支</h3></div><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-[10.5px] font-bold text-amber-800 bg-amber-100/70 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[12px]\">pending</span>等待修改</span></div><p class=\"font-serif text-[12.5px] text-stone-600 leading-snug mb-2\">子任务 2 完成后继续检查</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-2 border-t border-parchment-border/60 font-mono text-[11px] text-stone-500\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span>执行人: <strong class=\"text-stone-700 font-semibold\">Codex</strong></span><span class=\"text-stone-300\">·</span><span class=\"text-stone-400\">消耗: 25.6k Token</span></div><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[10px] text-amber-800 bg-amber-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-amber-900/10\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[11px]\">lock_clock</span>等待：保留报错前的输入 完成后接手</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-[#2a241f] text-[#ded6cb] rounded-lg px-3.5 py-2.5 border border-stone-700 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[11px]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-amber-500\">token</span><span>本轮总用量 <strong class=\"text-white font-bold\">68.8k</strong> Token</span><span class=\"text-stone-500 text-[10px]\">(Qoder 43.2k · Codex 25.6k)</span></div><a class=\"text-stone-300 hover:text-white text-[11px] underline decoration-dotted flex items-center gap-0.5 transition-colors\" href=\"#usage\"><span>查看用量说明</span><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[12px]\">arrow_forward</span></a></section></div>\n<!-- Atelier Bottom Compact Utility Dock -->\n<footer class=\"fixed bottom-0 left-0 right-0 max-w-[640px] mx-auto bg-[#f5efe4] border-t border-parchment-border px-4 py-2 z-50 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-stone-600 backdrop-blur-sm bg-opacity-95 shadow-[0_-2px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary\"></span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-700\">只读演示 · 协作任务实时同步中</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"font-bold text-primary hover:underline flex items-center gap-0.5\" href=\"#overview\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[13px]\">assignment</span>任务总览</a><span class=\"text-stone-300\">|</span><a class=\"font-bold text-stone-600 hover:text-stone-900 hover:underline flex items-center gap-0.5\" href=\"#session\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[13px]\">forum</span>子任务详情</a><span class=\"text-stone-300\">|</span><a class=\"font-bold text-stone-600 hover:text-stone-900 hover:underline flex items-center gap-0.5\" href=\"#usage\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[13px]\">analytics</span>用量说明</a></div></footer>\n</main>",
