    "html": "<main class=\"w-full max-w-[640px] paper-texture border border-paper-border rounded-xl flex flex-col overflow-hidden text-[14px] leading-relaxed shadow-lg\">\n<!-- 顶栏：导航与只读状态 -->\n<header class=\"px-5 py-3 border-b border-paper-border bg-paper-subtle flex items-center justify-between gap-3\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-ink-muted text-xs\">\n<a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-accent transition-colors font-medium text-ink\" href=\"#overview\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">arrow_back</span>\n<span>返回任务总览</span>\n</a>\n<span class=\"text-paper-border\">/</span>\n<span class=\"text-ink-muted\">子任务详情</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n<a class=\"text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted hover:text-ink flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors\" href=\"#usage\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[15px] text-ink-faint\">data_usage</span>\n<span>用量说明</span>\n</a>\n<div class=\"h-3 w-px bg-paper-border\"></div>\n<div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-paper border border-paper-border text-ink-muted text-[11px]\">\n<span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-green\"></span>\n<span>只读演示</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header>\n<!-- 子任务身份与层级说明卡 -->\n<section class=\"p-5 border-b border-paper-border bg-paper\">\n<!-- 父任务归属面包线 -->\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-ink-faint mb-2\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[15px] text-accent\">folder_open</span>\n<span class=\"text-ink-muted font-medium\">修复报表筛选异常</span>\n<span class=\"text-ink-faint\">›</span>\n<span class=\"text-ink font-semibold\">子任务 2</span>\n</div>\n<!-- 子任务标题与当前状态标签 -->\n<div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-2.5\">\n<h1 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold font-serif text-ink tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2\">\n          保留报错前的输入\n        </h1>\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium bg-brand-blue-soft text-brand-blue border border-brand-blue/20 shrink-0\">\n<span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-blue animate-pulse\"></span>\n<span>处理中</span>\n</span>\n</div>\n<!-- 任务要求说明文案 -->\n<p class=\"text-xs md:text-[13px] text-ink-muted mb-3.5 bg-paper-subtle p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-paper-border-soft\">\n<span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">任务说明：</span>请求失败时保留用户已填写的内容，并给出失败提示。不要直接清空。\n      </p>\n<!-- 属性卡片：执行人与独立用量 -->\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-ink-muted border-t border-paper-border-soft pt-3\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n<span class=\"text-ink-faint\">执行人：</span>\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium text-ink\">\n<span class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded bg-brand-blue text-white text-[10px] flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">Q</span>\n<span>Qoder</span>\n</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n<span class=\"text-ink-faint\">子任务用量：</span>\n<span class=\"font-mono font-medium text-ink\">30.8k Token</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 会话内容区 (只保留思考摘要与回复正文，按轮次阅读) -->\n<div class=\"p-5 flex flex-col gap-3.5 bg-paper custom-scroll max-h-[580px] overflow-y-auto\" id=\"session-scroll-area\"><!-- 较早轮次轻量折叠入口 -->\n<details class=\"group select-none\">\n<summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none py-1.5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-ink-faint hover:text-ink transition-colors\">\n<span class=\"toggle-chevron material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] transition-transform duration-200\">expand_more</span>\n<span>展开前面的 2 轮上下文记录 (14:02 - 14:04)</span>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"pl-5 pr-2 py-2 flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-xs text-ink-muted border-l border-paper-border ml-2 my-1.5\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"text-ink-faint font-mono mr-1.5\">14:02</span>\n<span class=\"text-ink font-medium\">主会话：</span>\n<span>派发子任务，提出清空筛选与表单异常隔离原则。</span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<span class=\"text-ink-faint font-mono mr-1.5\">14:04</span>\n<span class=\"text-ink-faint font-mono mr-1.5\">Qoder：</span>\n<span>排查报表组件生命周期，确认输入框与筛选状态绑定在同一清空函数下。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</details>\n<div class=\"h-px bg-paper-border-soft my-1\"></div>\n<!-- 轮次 1：Qoder 回复与思考摘要 -->\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs\">\n<span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Qoder</span>\n<span class=\"text-ink-faint text-[11px] font-mono\">14:08</span>\n</div>\n<!-- 极简思考摘要折叠 -->\n<details class=\"group\">\n<summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[12px] text-ink-faint hover:text-ink-muted select-none py-0.5\">\n<span class=\"toggle-chevron material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] transition-transform duration-200\">expand_more</span>\n<span>思考摘要：先确认草稿在请求前后的变化</span>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"pl-4 py-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed border-l border-paper-border-soft ml-1.5 mt-0.5\">\n      目前请求发出后就会清空输入，我计划分别验证成功与失败时的数据流向，确保失败分支保留草稿状态。\n    </div>\n</details>\n<div class=\"text-[14px] text-ink leading-relaxed\">\n    目前请求发出后就会清空输入。我会把清空放到成功之后，失败时保留草稿。\n  </div>\n</div>\n<!-- 轮次 2：主会话要求 -->\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5 pt-2\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs\">\n<span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">主会话</span>\n<span class=\"text-ink-faint text-[11px] font-mono\">14:14</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"text-[14px] text-ink leading-relaxed\">\n    失败时提示“请求失败，请重试”，输入内容保持原样。\n  </div>\n</div>\n<!-- 轮次 3：最新处理中进展 -->\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5 pt-2\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs\">\n<span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Qoder</span>\n<span class=\"text-ink-faint text-[11px] font-mono\">14:25</span>\n</div>\n<!-- 最新思考摘要折叠 -->\n<details class=\"group\">\n<summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[12px] text-ink-faint hover:text-ink-muted select-none py-0.5\">\n<span class=\"toggle-chevron material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] transition-transform duration-200\">expand_more</span>\n<span>思考摘要：正在检查失败后能否恢复草稿</span>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"pl-4 py-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed border-l border-paper-border-soft ml-1.5 mt-0.5\">\n      已调整表单提交流程：只有在后端返回成功状态时才触发清空操作。正在验证返回页面时的草稿恢复机制。\n    </div>\n</details>\n<div class=\"text-[14px] text-ink leading-relaxed font-normal\">\n    已改成请求成功后才清空。失败时会保留输入并给出提示，正在检查返回页面后能否继续恢复。\n  </div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- 悬浮辅助条：回到最新位置按钮（平滑查看历史不被滚回，可一键复位） -->\n<div class=\"px-5 py-2.5 border-t border-paper-border bg-paper flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-ink-muted\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink-faint text-[11px]\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\">info</span>\n<span>查看历史记录时不会打断当前阅读</span>\n</div>\n<button class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-paper-subtle border border-paper-border hover:bg-paper hover:text-ink text-ink-muted font-medium transition-colors\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\">arrow_downward</span>\n<span>回到最新</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n<!-- 底栏：原型状态与任务层级流转说明 -->\n<footer class=\"px-5 py-3 border-t border-paper-border bg-paper-subtle flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-ink-faint\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-ink-faint\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-ink-faint\"></span><span>子任务会话详情</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-ink-muted\"><a class=\"hover:text-accent transition-colors font-medium\" href=\"#overview\">返回任务总览</a><span>·</span><a class=\"hover:text-accent transition-colors font-medium\" href=\"#usage\">用量说明</a></div></footer>\n</main>",
    "fonts": [
      "1d7a0b663a566e6ff530.css",
      "e6154908c44c742b6ee9.css"
    ]
  },
